[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3188785782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109604#issuecomment-3188785782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109604","id":3188785782,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-EQJ2","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-14T15:03:13Z","updated_at":"2025-08-14T15:03:13Z","body":"Turns out that MSVC is one of the \"not clever enough\" compiler.😆 Adding this constexpr makes windows editor production build 3KB smaller.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3188785782/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":4,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3208687009","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109604#issuecomment-3208687009","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109604","id":3208687009,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_QK2h","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T01:57:38Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T02:00:27Z","body":"> It's worth noting that compilers can be pretty opaque, and the reduction may come as a result of context rather than it not inlining these specific if clauses. 3kb is certainly small enough of a difference that I wouldn't be confident it's a reliable save.\r\n\r\nYeah, compilation is a quite complex process, and small variations in results can arise for various reasons. I just want to point out that this kind of changes can sometimes also help make the compiler’s behavior more predictable (e.g., in debug builds).\r\n\r\n> To the change, I'm somewhat indifferent. I'm not sure we should go around and churn functions that work fine, when we know the change isn't expected to have an impact (gcc and clang should already factor out the `if`). That said, I won't oppose merging it on this basis.\r\n\r\nAs this is more like a code-style PR, it admittedly lacks strong motivation—especially since #108121 already includes these changes (I hadn’t noticed that and ended up duplicating the work (lol))—so if you merge #108121, I don’t mind closing this one.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3208687009/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3310844820","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109604#issuecomment-3310844820","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109604","id":3310844820,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FV3uU","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T06:51:14Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T06:51:14Z","body":"Closes as #108121 has been merged.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3310844820/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":